    <obo:IAO_0000115>AnalyzerPro​ is a productivity software application for both low and high resolution LC-MS and GC-MS data with support for multiple vendors’ data. This comprehensive post-processing utility provides optimized workflows for sample-to-sample comparison, target component analysis, quantitation and library searching for data generated from any LC-MS and GC-MS platform</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000117>Allyson Lister</obo:IAO_0000117>
    <dc:contributor>Allyson Lister</dc:contributor>
    <dc:contributor>Mark Reuter</dc:contributor>
    <dcterms:creator>Allyson Lister</dcterms:creator>
    <dcterms:creator>Mark Reuter</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:comment>AL 21.10.2019: Added in reference to https://github.com/allysonlister/swo/issues/31</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>AnalyzerPro</rdfs:label>
