    <obo:IAO_0000115>The aCGH package functions for reading data from image analysis output files and clone information files, creation of aCGH S3 objects for storing these data. Basic methods for accessing/replacing, subsetting, printing and plotting aCGH objects.</obo:IAO_0000115>
