    <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
    <owl:annotatedTarget>SWATH is the only data independent acquisition (DIA) technique that allows comprehensive detection and quantitation of virtually every detectable compound in a sample (MS/MSALL). This provides confidence in your quantitative results and virtually eliminates the risk of missing a critical component. SWATH Acquisition strategy can only be achieved through the power and speed of SCIEX TripleTOF® and QTOF technology.</owl:annotatedTarget>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>https://sciex.com/technology/swath-acquisition</obo:IAO_0000119>
  </rdf:Description>
