    <obo:IAO_0000115>Acuity is the complete enterprise microarray informatics platform for microarray data storage, data filtering and data analysis. It analysis tools for quality, visualizations for discovery and  Data Management for Security.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.bio-medicine.org/</obo:IAO_0000119>
