    <obo:IAO_0000115>The MHAS Data Policy is a vendor-specific license which requires that users attribute the data properly. The data is accessible free of charge to all commercial and non-commercial users. </obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.mhasweb.org/Data.aspx, accessed 13 July 2016.</obo:IAO_0000119>
