    <obo:IAO_0000115>The Facebase Data Access Policy specifies under what legal requirements Facebase data may be accessed. Non-sensitive data is available for use for all purposes and usages. As consent must be aquired for sensitive (or closed) data, this license only covers the use of the open data (a separate agreement must be entered into for restricted access data).</obo:IAO_0000115>
