    <obo:IAO_0000115>The GeneNetwork Conditions of Use describes the data licensing for the resource covered. Commercial and non-commercial use is allowed, though attribution is requested via either acknowledgement or co-authorship. Further restrictions on the bulk download of as-yet unpublished data is also described. (While mentioned in the document, software licensing is not the focus of this conditions of use and therefore is not modelled here.)</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://www.genenetwork.org/conditionsofUse.html, accessed 7 July 2016.</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Allyson Lister</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">GeneNetwork Conditions of Use</rdfs:label>
