    <obo:IAO_0000115>LibSBML is a free, open-source programming library to help you read, write, manipulate, translate, and validate SBML files and data streams. It provides interfaces for C, C++, C#(.NET), Java, MATLAB, Octave, Perl, Python R and Ruby. LibSBML is available for free under LGPL terms in both source-code form and precompiled binaries for Windows, Mac OS X, and Linux.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://sbml.org/SBML_Software_Guide/SBML_Software_Summary, accessed 27 March 2015.</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Allyson Lister</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">libSBML</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
