    <obo:IAO_0000115>affxparser is a package for parsing Affymetrix files (CDF, CEL, CHP, BPMAP, BAR). It provides methods for fast and memory efficient parsing of Affymetrix files using the Affymetrix' Fusion SDK.</obo:IAO_0000115>
