    <edamontology:subset>edam</edamontology:subset>
    <edamontology:subset>formats</edamontology:subset>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>The Resource Description Framework (RDF) is a general-purpose language for representing information in the Web.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-rdf-syntax/</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>James Malone</dcterms:creator>
    <dcterms:creator>Jon Ison</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:comment>Data in RDF format can be serialised into XML, textual, or binary format.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment>Merged with now-obsolete EDAM class 'RDF' http://edamontology.org/format_2376 by Allyson Lister.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>RDF</rdfs:label>
