    <obo:IAO_0000115>genArise is an easy to use tool for dual color microarray data. Its GUI-Tk based environment let any non-experienced user performs a basic, but not simple, data analysis just following a wizard. In addition it provides some tools for the developer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/genArise.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Nandini Badarinarayan</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label>'genArise'</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
