    <obo:IAO_0000115>Clustering specification is a single generalization specification is a generalization specification and denotes a type of generalization that models the mapping of a set of objects S of type T from S to a set of natural numbers {1,...K}. This generalization is obtained by appliing a clustering algorithm on a set of data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
