    <obo:IAO_0000115>The lumi package provides an integrated solution for the Illumina microarray data analysis. It includes functions of Illumina BeadStudio data input, quality control, BeadArray-specific variance stabilization, normalization and gene annotation at the probe level.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/lumi.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Nandini Badarinarayan</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label>lumi</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
