    <obo:IAO_0000115>OS X is a Mac OS operating system which succeeds the original Mac OS, which had been Apple's primary operating system since 1984. Unlike the earlier Macintosh operating system, OS X is a Unix-based operating system.</obo:IAO_0000115>
