    <obo:IAO_0000112>mean calculation</obo:IAO_0000112>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A descriptive statistical calculation objective is a data transformation objective which concerns any calculation intended to describe a feature of a data set, for example, its center or its variability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
