    <obo:IAO_0000115>affyContam is software which provides the in silico creation of quality problems in CEL-level data to help evaluate performance of quality metrics. In essence, it creates structured corruption within CEL data to demonstrate QA effectiveness.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/affyContam.html (access unknown); http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/2.12/bioc/vignettes/affyContam/inst/doc/affyContam.pdf, accessed 22 May 2013.</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Allyson Lister</dcterms:creator>
    <dcterms:creator>Nandini Badarinarayan</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label>affyContam</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
