    <obo:IAO_0000115>The NIH Genomic Data Sharing Policy specifies under what legal requirements NIH genomic data may be accessed. Access to human data is through a tiered model involving unrestricted- and controlled-data
access mechanisms. Requests for controlled-access data are reviewed by NIH Data Access Committees (DACs).</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>https://gds.nih.gov/PDF/NIH_GDS_Policy.pdf</obo:IAO_0000119>
