    <obo:IAO_0000115>MathML 2.0 is an XML format which is a low-level specification for describing mathematics as a basis for machine to machine communication. It is a W3C Recommendation and was released on 21 Feb 2001. A product of the W3C Math working group, it provides a much needed foundation for the inclusion of mathematical expressions in Web pages.</obo:IAO_0000115>
