  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SWO_3000071">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000098"/>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Genomedata provides a way to store and access large-scale functional genomics data in a format which is both space-efficient and allows efficient random-access. Genomedata archives are implemented as one or more HDF5 files, either as single files or as directory archives. HDF5 archives are self describing, like XML, but may also contain more complex structures such contain binary data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
    <obo:IAO_0000119>http://pmgenomics.ca/hoffmanlab/proj/genomedata/doc/1.3.5/genomedata.html and http://www.hdfgroup.org/why_hdf/, accessed 27 November 2014.</obo:IAO_0000119>
    <dcterms:creator>Allyson Lister</dcterms:creator>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">genomedata format</rdfs:label>
  </rdf:Description>
